1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,872
Picture two people.

2
00:00:03,072 --> 00:00:06,096
In the same year, they both lose the same kind of job.

3
00:00:06,646 --> 00:00:09,454
One spends the next few years resenting the world.

4
00:00:09,654 --> 00:00:13,650
The other spends that time learning, and starts building something.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,944
A few years later, they're living completely different lives.

6
00:00:18,494 --> 00:00:19,790
It was the same bottom.

7
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:22,078
So what made the difference?

8
00:00:22,278 --> 00:00:26,490
Today, let's talk about the hardest seasons of life.

9
00:00:26,689 --> 00:00:33,998
And at the end, I'll tell you how a woodcutter who couldn't even read understood everything in a single moment.

10
00:00:35,147 --> 00:00:37,559
Almost everyone goes through hard times.

11
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:38,983
But here's what we think.

12
00:00:39,184 --> 00:00:40,696
I shouldn't have to struggle.

13
00:00:40,896 --> 00:00:42,480
Why doesn't everyone like me?

14
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:45,632
Why isn't anything going my way?

15
00:00:46,182 --> 00:00:48,342
But why shouldn't you ever struggle?

16
00:00:48,542 --> 00:00:52,754
Why should everyone like you, and everything go exactly the way you want?

17
00:00:53,304 --> 00:00:56,184
Your soul wants to experience many different things.

18
00:00:56,384 --> 00:01:03,296
Once you remember who you are, to a certain degree, creating the life you want becomes much easier.

19
00:01:03,496 --> 00:01:09,148
But before that, your soul wants to experience a lot, in order to remember itself.

20
00:01:09,348 --> 00:01:11,328
And some of that is hard.

21
00:01:12,478 --> 00:01:16,905
Material wealth comes and goes, and goes and comes.

22
00:01:17,106 --> 00:01:22,902
That might be because you don't yet know how to create well, or you're using it the wrong way.

23
00:01:23,452 --> 00:01:26,548
But maybe, your soul chose that season.

24
00:01:26,748 --> 00:01:32,508
Some souls deliberately begin life in harsher, more difficult circumstances.

25
00:01:32,708 --> 00:01:40,268
In the same way, there are times when the soul wants to experience lack, hardship, and falling all the way to the bottom.

26
00:01:40,468 --> 00:01:41,764
To learn something there.

27
00:01:42,914 --> 00:01:47,018
And it's exactly in that season that the difference shows.

28
00:01:47,568 --> 00:01:51,744
Some people learn at the bottom, grow, and create something.

29
00:01:51,944 --> 00:01:56,876
Others lose hope in the world, blame others, and even try to hurt them.

30
00:01:57,426 --> 00:02:00,594
Everyone feels hurt and low sometimes.

31
00:02:00,794 --> 00:02:03,277
That feeling isn't wrong.

32
00:02:03,478 --> 00:02:08,193
But what you do with that season, that's the difference between souls.

33
00:02:08,394 --> 00:02:10,590
That's a soul's true character.

34
00:02:11,140 --> 00:02:14,236
A soul's character doesn't show when things are going well.

35
00:02:14,436 --> 00:02:16,668
It shows at the very bottom.

36
00:02:17,818 --> 00:02:24,190
So, there may be a stretch of time where, no matter what you do, things are truly hard.

37
00:02:24,740 --> 00:02:28,232
When that happens, remember just three things.

38
00:02:28,782 --> 00:02:30,870
Try to learn one more thing.

39
00:02:31,070 --> 00:02:32,726
Don't lose the love inside you.

40
00:02:32,926 --> 00:02:38,290
And stay as calm as you can, moving through it one step at a time.

41
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:41,828
The darkest hour is right before dawn.

42
00:02:42,028 --> 00:02:46,203
People who move through that season this way, great success finds them.

43
00:02:46,404 --> 00:02:50,400
Because what they learned at the bottom becomes the vessel that can hold it.

44
00:02:51,549 --> 00:02:57,814
It used to be believed that growth like this took countless lifetimes on Earth, learning little by little.

45
00:02:58,013 --> 00:02:59,921
But now it's different.

46
00:03:00,471 --> 00:03:13,251
The Indian sage Sri Yukteswar taught that humanity passed through its darkest age, and around the year sixteen ninety-nine entered a rising age when consciousness begins to awaken again.

47
00:03:13,451 --> 00:03:17,843
Western astrology calls this current the Age of Aquarius.

48
00:03:18,043 --> 00:03:22,363
And many spiritual teachers say Earth's vibration is rising.

49
00:03:22,914 --> 00:03:25,866
The names are different, but they say the same thing.

50
00:03:26,065 --> 00:03:28,729
Awakening is happening much faster than before.

51
00:03:29,279 --> 00:03:32,015
And when you think about it, it makes sense.

52
00:03:32,215 --> 00:03:38,372
People used to wander the mountains their whole lives searching for a teacher, just to hear one line of wisdom.

53
00:03:38,571 --> 00:03:42,243
Now, anyone can find it in a single video, like this one.

54
00:03:42,793 --> 00:03:46,537
In Buddhism, there's a word for sudden awakening.

55
00:03:46,737 --> 00:03:48,717
Here's the story I promised.

56
00:03:48,917 --> 00:03:51,761
Huineng was a woodcutter who couldn't read.

57
00:03:51,962 --> 00:04:00,061
While selling firewood in the market, he heard someone reciting a single line of the Diamond Sutra, and in that moment, it's said, he awakened.

58
00:04:00,612 --> 00:04:07,128
So these days, even within one lifetime, you can level up in a big, dynamic way.

59
00:04:08,278 --> 00:04:13,030
From a higher, wider, deeper view, it's okay however it turns out.

60
00:04:13,230 --> 00:04:15,786
Ultimately, we are all that is.

61
00:04:15,986 --> 00:04:17,029
We are light.

62
00:04:17,579 --> 00:04:22,656
Good experiences and bad experiences do exist here, in this Earth reality.

63
00:04:22,856 --> 00:04:25,088
But at the same time, they don't.

64
00:04:25,288 --> 00:04:27,556
Everything is simply experience.

65
00:04:28,706 --> 00:04:30,794
So how do you find your way?

66
00:04:31,344 --> 00:04:35,880
Breathe more deeply, and spend more time being calm and still.

67
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:40,508
And little by little, make the choices that bring your soul joy.

68
00:04:40,707 --> 00:04:42,652
They don't have to be big decisions.

69
00:04:42,852 --> 00:04:46,488
Start with what you eat for lunch today, or the path you walk.

70
00:04:47,037 --> 00:04:51,393
Live like that, and the way begins to appear, like the hand of God.

71
00:04:51,943 --> 00:04:53,023
Where to go.

72
00:04:53,223 --> 00:04:55,635
What to learn, and what to create.

73
00:04:55,835 --> 00:04:56,807
Who you'll meet.

74
00:04:57,008 --> 00:04:59,599
What to start, and what to take on.

75
00:05:00,150 --> 00:05:02,741
A meeting too perfect to be coincidence.

76
00:05:02,941 --> 00:05:05,102
A name that keeps catching your eye.

77
00:05:05,301 --> 00:05:07,246
A door that suddenly opens.

78
00:05:07,445 --> 00:05:13,890
Through strange and mysterious events, the way is shown to you, one step at a time.

79
00:05:14,439 --> 00:05:16,347
Your job isn't to chase it down.

80
00:05:16,547 --> 00:05:19,175
It's to become still, and notice.

81
00:05:19,725 --> 00:05:27,069
Follow how your soul feels, and your own path, your own path to abundance, opens like an automatic door.

82
00:05:28,219 --> 00:05:31,856
So starting today, try just three things.

83
00:05:32,405 --> 00:05:36,581
One, on hard days, write just one line.

84
00:05:36,781 --> 00:05:38,473
What am I learning in this season?

85
00:05:39,023 --> 00:05:43,199
Two, once a day, do one small kindness for someone.

86
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:47,143
It's the easiest way to keep the love inside you alive.

87
00:05:47,693 --> 00:05:52,049
Three, five minutes a day, breathe deeply and become still.

88
00:05:52,249 --> 00:05:54,661
The way shows itself when you're still.

89
00:05:55,811 --> 00:05:59,375
So let's take one minute together, right now.

90
00:05:59,925 --> 00:06:02,481
Sit comfortably and close your eyes.

91
00:06:06,031 --> 00:06:07,687
Breathe in slowly…

92
00:06:11,887 --> 00:06:14,083
and breathe out, long.

93
00:06:19,633 --> 00:06:20,569
Once more.

94
00:06:20,769 --> 00:06:22,425
Breathe in slowly…

95
00:06:26,625 --> 00:06:28,821
and breathe out, long.

96
00:06:34,371 --> 00:06:36,783
Think of one hardship you're going through right now.

97
00:06:42,333 --> 00:06:49,317
Now imagine yourself, a few years from now, when everything has worked out, looking back at you today.

98
00:06:54,867 --> 00:06:58,971
That future you says: thank you for holding on back then.

99
00:07:01,171 --> 00:07:04,303
Because of that time, I'm who I am now.

100
00:07:08,853 --> 00:07:10,545
Just receive those words.

101
00:07:17,095 --> 00:07:19,507
Now, take a deep breath in…

102
00:07:23,707 --> 00:07:27,343
and as you slowly breathe out, open your eyes.

103
00:07:31,493 --> 00:07:35,921
At the same bottom, some people fall apart, and some people rise.

104
00:07:36,121 --> 00:07:37,921
The difference isn't luck.

105
00:07:38,121 --> 00:07:40,137
It's the character of the soul.

106
00:07:40,687 --> 00:07:47,563
If you're at the bottom right now, learn, don't lose your love, and move calmly, one step at a time.

107
00:07:47,763 --> 00:07:54,099
Then become still, and notice the way opening, like the hand of God.

108
00:07:54,649 --> 00:07:58,141
Write one thing you're learning at the bottom right now in the comments.

109
00:07:58,341 --> 00:08:01,329
For someone, that one line might be a light.

110
00:08:01,879 --> 00:08:03,067
Play your own game.
